&lt;p style="line-height: 18px; text-align: left"&gt; &lt;img alt="0101010_016.jpg" src="images/0101010_016.jpg" style="height: 170px; width: 256.6px"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
